%% 档案（2026-09-19 订正）：原图描述旧感知层（VisionLaneDetector/MiniMapReader/SignDetector/SensorFusion/FusedDriveState、DriveMode 含 fused 档），
%% 上述类与档位已从代码删除（当前 DriveMode = e2e/yolo/recover/rule，见 AuroraDriveApp.swift:793-798；旧类 grep 全仓 0 命中）。
%% 本图按 git 7b7d2db 现状重绘；原图历史版本见 git show 7b7d2db:docs/sequence-diagram.mermaid。
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant SCK as ScreenCaptureKit
    participant CE as CaptureEngine (captureQueue·后台)
    participant YOLO as YoloEngine (inferenceQueue·后台)
    participant M9 as InferenceEngine m9_mono (后台)
    participant OCR as SpeedOCRReader (后台, 15Hz)
    participant NET as CoordinateCapture 网络定位 (10Hz, 仅地图显示)
    participant MAIN as DriveState.tick (主线程 30Hz)
    participant STM as DegradeStateMachine (主线程)
    participant CTRL as RuleController / EscapeController (主线程)
    participant KEY as ControlEngine CGEvent (主线程)
    participant REC as RecordEngine
    participant UI as SwiftUI (主线程)

    SCK->>CE: 帧 CMSampleBuffer
    CE->>CE: 源缓冲 → NSImage / YOLO CVPixelBuffer 缓冲池
    CE-->>MAIN: onFrame(NSImage, CGImage) → currentScreenImage
    CE->>YOLO: onYoloFrame(CVPixelBuffer) → inferFast()
    YOLO-->>MAIN: detections（NMS+平滑后）
    M9-->>MAIN: 端到端命令（当前帧推理结果）
    OCR-->>MAIN: 速度快照（PP-OCRv6 主 / CNN 备, 静止帧缓存）
    NET-->>UI: 航点坐标（10Hz 旁路，不参与驾驶决策）

    loop 每帧 tick (30Hz)
        MAIN->>MAIN: 读各感知最新快照 + yoloEngine.detections
        MAIN->>STM: update(m9Live, yoloLive, ...)
        STM-->>MAIN: DriveMode (e2e/yolo/recover/rule; UI 合并为 2 档 e2eDrive/ruleFallback)
        alt mode == .e2e
            MAIN->>KEY: M9 端到端 command
        else mode == .yolo
            MAIN->>KEY: YOLO 框 → 接管控制
        else mode == .recover
            MAIN->>CTRL: EscapeController（脱困）
        else mode == .rule
            MAIN->>CTRL: RuleController（YOLO 检测 + 手写规则兜底）
        end
        CTRL-->>MAIN: ControlCommand
        MAIN->>KEY: applyCommand → postKeyEvent/postMouseEvent (CGEvent)
        MAIN->>REC: recordFrameIfNeeded
        MAIN->>UI: @Observable 自动刷新（GameHUDWindow/小地图）
    end
